{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1361.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"333d0f41a84182506d1faddde6124132afbcf95cf0f7a3129cb6b833a3c6e962","ja":"そっか～！　撮影中に、志保の動きが誰かに\n似てるな～って感じたことがあったんだけど……。","zh":"原来是这样啊～！拍摄的时候，我总觉得志保的动作\n很像某个人来着……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1361.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"968e6819adebfbb998ec5d8dae20c29160fc938fda7cafd5b58da49241d1933c","ja":"●●●●プロデューサーさんだったんだね！\nなんか答え合わせできてスッキリしちゃった！","zh":"原来是●●●●制作人啊！\n总觉得对完答案之后整个人都舒畅了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1361.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"4a8fa647c4125a2a814717d877923eb5be2b73878e710e2a9a976d8a5f30fc7b","ja":"たしかに、●●●●プロデューサーさんなら、\nいつも会うし、じっくり観察できるね。","zh":"确实，如果是●●●●制作人，\n经常能见到，也能仔细观察呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1361.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"7a557c4640e620d03113c88e993a81781c9698e679502a523c92332a6a0e1fa4","ja":"ま、まあ……。別に、そんなにじっくり\n観察してたわけじゃないですけど……。","zh":"也、也是啦……。我也并不是特意\n观察得那么仔细就是了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1361.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"61fedaba39ff084805a2266b8c6f63d6d8adee3e609968320ca63832fe090306","ja":"でも、すごくいいと思うよ。\nそういう勉強なら、私もできるかも♪","zh":"不过，我觉得挺好的哦。\n如果是这种学习的话，我说不定也能做到呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1361.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"8eb90b85e197c5ea78749a03f1bc125ab7e63b42ec8af3cf49aa3bafba608842","ja":"私も、今後の役作りのためにやってみようかな……。\n●●●●プロデューサーさんの動き、マネしてみるね。","zh":"我也为了之后的塑造角色来试试看吧……\n我要模仿制作人●●●●的动作咯。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1361.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"462570666239c2b4aef18d16de9b3a4abd1a3b280386c04643312ed1058d6641","ja":"ね、どうだった？","zh":"呐，觉得怎么样？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1361.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"a71b5be93659dec705fb1fde328b13abba84048bd0d180f5758e736e76b81081","ja":"ちょっと、違うように思います。\n歩くときは、もうちょっとこう……。","zh":"我觉得有些不太对。\n走的时候，应该再稍微这样……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1361.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"eadac955acda4d1b40690bbde5d3ce2434b1613b0b69cb6d1502e73b8fc5855f","ja":"やっぱり、志保は●●●●プロデューサーさんのこと、\nすごく観察して勉強したんだね！","zh":"看来志保真的有好好观察\n并向●●●●制作人学习呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1361.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"2cf91d6a35801d58f10bde68f47b3b71d1f66e4aaad3d2478652935cdf413644","ja":"だ、だから別に、そんなに観察してたわけじゃ……。","zh":"我、我才没有特意去观察什么……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1361.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"89d5f3b14fe7ed0d2a6c7b8447b3f6ba868445551b0f79866c49da72ddbed21e","ja":"簡単にはマネできないか……。私、ちょっと\n●●●●プロデューサーさんを観察してくるね！","zh":"没那么容易模仿得来吗……我去观察\n一会儿●●●●制作人先生哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1361.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"4f0ba8b23c0b505bebf5ef0b0178f076d58eed3f615fca376fa99268f8bf56b3","ja":"私も行くー！　あっ、志保も一緒に行って、\n●●●●プロデューサーさんのマネのコツ、教えて♪","zh":"我也要去～！啊，志保也一起去，\n教我模仿●●●●制作人的诀窍嘛♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1361.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"0982774a110ae5e93f5318401d3bf73d9412b114d4d7df873e30496489faefcc","ja":"えっ、本人の前でそんなこと……。\nちょっと、ひっぱらないで、分かったから……。","zh":"诶，当着本人的面怎么能说那种话……\n等下，别拉我啦，我知道了就是了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
